  "name": "Example: \n                    Reflecting a Geometric Figure",
  "problem": "Reflect the figure shown below across the line $l.$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14222660/assets/65fc37670764a572b0cfbbfd4dcd577bafc60e79ff68d5776b13ef54aa346f1e.png)",
  "worked_solution": "To reflect a polygon across a line, we \n\n- reflect the vertices of the polygon, and then\n\n- draw the edges connecting the reflected vertices.\n\nTherefore, reflecting our polygon across the line $l$, we obtain the following result:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14222660/assets/1dc3f898405c7b18b563711f0b0dcdbbcdd5d6c64e004ab3a754cf636abef0ca.png)",
