                          max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>To reflect a polygon across a line, we </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>reflect the vertices of the polygon, and then</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>draw the edges connecting the reflected vertices.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, reflecting our polygon across the line <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"0.693ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 298.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">l</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-6C\" d=\"M117 59Q117 26 142 26Q179 26 205 131Q211 151 215 152Q217 153 225 153H229Q238 153 241 153T246 151T248 144Q247 138 245 128T234 90T214 43T183 6T137 -11Q101 -11 70 11T38 85Q38 97 39 102L104 360Q167 615 167 623Q167 626 166 628T162 632T157 634T149 635T141 636T132 637T122 637Q112 637 109 637T101 638T95 641T94 647Q94 649 96 661Q101 680 107 682T179 688Q194 689 213 690T243 693T254 694Q266 694 266 686Q266 675 193 386T118 83Q118 81 118 75T117 65V59Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMATHI-6C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>, we obtain the following result:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-abaa91fcf16539cbe71b75c2de1e074d\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/abaa91fcf16539cbe71b75c2de1e074d\"></div>\n            </div>           \n        </div>",
